**/*.osm
**/*.osm.pbf
**/*.zip
**/*.tif
**/.env
**/.token*
**/node_modules

# Build output, none of it tracked. Every context here is the repository root and the
# otp-graph-build image does COPY pipeline/, so anything unlisted is uploaded and then baked into a
# layer: the LMDB stores and the per-feed validators match none of the extensions above. Entries
# here are context-root-relative and * does not cross a /, so `work` is this directory's own, not
# .gitignore's any-depth match of the same word.
work
pipeline/data
pipeline/input
pipeline/state
**/*.obj
